OL,1,Vk4                              G17/25
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGLINFORD CHRISTIE
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGAWARDED DAMAGES
OL,4,D
OL,5, Sprinter Linford Christie has been
OL,6, awarded substantial damages for
OL,7, wrongful arrest and libel.
OL,9,FMr Christie was arrested in London
OL,10,Fafter the Seoul Olympics on suspicion
OL,11,Fof being in a stolen car which had,
OL,12,Fin fact, been lent to him.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FLawyers for Mr Christie said the
OL,15,Fout-of-court settlement with
OL,16,FMetropolitan Police Commissioner Peter
OL,17,FImbert was in excess of #30,000.
OL,19,FMr Imbert said he regretted Mr
OL,20,FChristie's arrest and the subsequent
OL,21,Freport in a national newspaper.
OL,23,T]FFromG13-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
